{
  "title": "How to Play",
  "steps": [
    "<strong>Goal:</strong> Change one letter at a time to discover and reach the target word.",
    "1. <strong>Change one letter</strong> from the previous word.",
    "2. <strong>Rearrange letters</strong> any way you want.",
    "3. Submit a word to <strong>discover key letters</strong>.",
    "4. <strong>Keep changing one letter at a time</strong> until you make a word using all key letters to win!",
